.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:507:16:An adversarial review during v1.4.0 planning surfaced a second concern: "pure factors" cannot take an `EntityId` parameter and still be pure. A function that takes an ID implicitly reads the database, carries a hidden clock, or depends on global state — all of which break determinism under [ADR-0104](0104-execution-mode-and-mode-aware-services.md)'s `Evaluate` mode and defeat [ADR-0110](0110-evaluation-harness-for-abilities.md)'s fixture-replay guarantees.
