.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:6675:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-7.log:6755:+Keep the table. Deriving from Provenance envelopes fails the product contract: it cannot enforce a synchronous tombstone PRE-GATE, cannot answer "all claims about subject X" without replaying historical ability outputs, cannot carry user feedback and repair jobs as first-class targets, and cannot preserve 9 legacy dismissal sources under one immutable identity. Provenance becomes `provenance_json` plus source/corroboration rows, not the storage root.
