.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:7078:.docs/decisions/0115-signal-granularity-audit.md:56:- **PropagateAsync { coalesce }** — emitted to the event log, an invalidation job is enqueued for each affected output. If `coalesce = true`, jobs for the same `(SignalType, EntityId)` collapse within a configurable window. Example: `EntityUpdated { coalesce: true }`, `ClaimTrustChanged { coalesce: true }`, `AbilityOutputChanged { coalesce: true }`.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:7083:.docs/decisions/0115-signal-granularity-audit.md:163:- Synthetic workload: 1,000 `ClaimTrustChanged` per minute + 100 `AbilityOutputChanged` per minute sustained for 10 minutes.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:7086:.docs/decisions/0115-signal-granularity-audit.md:299:`ClaimTrustChanged` uses `EntityAndField`. `AbilityOutputChanged` uses `OutputId`. `EntityUpdated` uses `EntityId` (current behavior). Per-type default in the registry, overridable by config.
