.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/DOS-210.md:15:- 2026-04-20 plan-eng-review locked **compile-time AST inspection** as the category enforcement mechanism. The macro analyzes the ability's function body AST at compile time, detecting transitive calls into `services::*` mutation functions. Read and Transform abilities with any detected mutation-path call fail to compile. Publish/Maintenance allowed; descriptors record inferred mutation set.
