.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1419:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:50:- The `maintenance_audit` table stores the full `ProvenanceOrMasked` per invocation.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1420:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:52:- [ADR-0094](0094-audit-log-and-enterprise-observability.md)'s append-only JSONL security audit remains unchanged — it captures security events (auth, permissions, source revocations, etc.) with its existing hygiene rules. Provenance lives in the operational `maintenance_audit` SQLite table, separate from the security audit.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1421:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:56:A universal renderer transforms `Provenance` into an actor-appropriate view:
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1422:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:59:pub fn render_provenance_for(prov: &Provenance, actor: Actor, surface: Surface) -> RenderedProvenance { ... }
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1423:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:80:3. **URL stripping.** Anything resembling a URL (regex-based) is removed and replaced with `[url removed]`. If the explanation wants to cite a URL, it must come through a typed `SourceAttribution` with a URL field, not through free text.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1424:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:81:4. **Banned token list.** Explanations containing instruction-like phrases common in prompt injection attempts (e.g., "ignore previous", "you are now", "system:") are filtered: the whole explanation is replaced with `[explanation removed by sanitizer]` and a `ProvenanceWarning::ExplanationFiltered` is added.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1425:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:86:### 4. The `ProvenanceMasked` Shape
.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1427:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:91:pub struct ProvenanceMasked {
