.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-7.log:1159:.docs/decisions/0125-claim-anatomy-temporal-sensitivity-typeregistry.md:11:The 2026-04-24 Claim Anatomy Review (`.docs/plans/claim-anatomy-review-2026-04-24.md`) walked every dimension a claim should express in the v1.4.x substrate. Three dimensions were under-scrutinized at the substrate level and warrant a substrate primitive in v1.4.0 spine:
