.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:762:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:461:     → source_asof = None AND emit ProvenanceWarning::SourceTimestampUnknown { fallback: ObservedAt }
