.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:764:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:483:  - timestamp > now + 30 days (near-future; legitimate for renewal dates but suspicious for source_asof)
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:765:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:498:- Auto-classifier for inferring `source_asof` from claim_text content (v1.5.x+).
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:766:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:499:- Backfill of `source_asof` from sources OTHER than existing `ItemSource.sourced_at` (e.g., re-fetching Glean documents to recover their timestamps for old claims). This is post-spine cleanup if needed.
