.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:1118:1. Every field in the ability's domain output MUST have an entry in `field_attributions`. No "optional for Read" escape hatch — Read abilities' fields are typically `Direct` with `ConfidenceKind::Implicit`, which is trivial to populate but must exist.
