.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:2099:**Why now:** SubjectAttribution (this morning), ThreadId (this afternoon), and recency / `source_asof` (later this afternoon) all surfaced as substrate gaps reactively. Each was real. The pattern suggests there are more. Cheap to enumerate before code starts; expensive after.
