    85	Rollback before successful migration version recording is the existing migration backup path (`src-tauri/src/migrations.rs:1019-1026`). After success, rollback is a forward fix: keep the columns, tighten registry metadata, and re-run affected backfill/commit tests. Dropping columns is not worth the risk on the load-bearing claim table.
