   117	
   118	Repair rollback is idempotency. Rerunning repair after partial success recomputes projections from active claims and overwrites the same deterministic target state. DB targets run in their own transaction; file target uses the DOS-311 fence and records failed again if the epoch advances or the filesystem write fails.
   119	
   120	W1-B universal write fence is honored: all `intelligence.json` projection writes go through `fenced_write_intelligence_json`. Direct `write_intelligence_json` remains implementation-only inside `intelligence/io.rs` and `intelligence/write_fence.rs` (`scripts/check_write_fence_usage.sh:12-22`).
